        "id": 173967,
        "name": "deddragon",
        "username": "deddragon",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/deddragon/{size}/2335_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-15T15:08:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mine have not returned, though I can still earn new ones. I’m not going to bother doing them all again, as I’m sure I will then only receive Fine. Except Sleep-walking Papers… still haven’t beaten that one…</p>\n<p>A secondary issue has also arisen twice now. If I exit the One-shot and return later to finish it (via the continue button) I do not receive a Mint rating for it. In fact, it doesn’t give any rating at all. However, when I redo the One-shot I only get Near-mint. I tested this with Hero We Need, exiting before any cards were even played and continuing 2 days later. No Mint, only to get Near when I completed it the second time. Does anyone know if this is as intended? I wasn’t required to complete the game in one sitting before the expansion update.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:57:14.273Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
