        "created_at": "2016-05-15T16:09:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I remember it, MigrantP said that if the client loses contact with the servers at any time, Mint goes out the window. &nbsp;This is a bigger issue with mobile clients obviously, but I guess it could happen with Steam as well.</p>",
