        "created_at": "2016-05-15T22:08:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Are you offline when you complete it? It should work, but there apparently could still be some edge cases where there are problems.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I don’t remember about the first time it happened, but yes I was definitely offline when I completed it this time.</p>\n<p>But that hasn’t previously been an issue. Once a week I connect to wifi with my tablet to download the weekly One-shot and any updates I have, but otherwise I am offline with it. I don’t have wifi at home <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
